## Before you order sod — check your base

A new lawn needs 4–6 inches of quality topsoil under the sod for proper root establishment. Use the [Topsoil Calculator](/calculator/topsoil) to calculate how much topsoil you need before ordering sod.

## Ordering tips

1. **Confirm your supplier's pallet size** — 450 sq ft is standard but can vary ±5%.
2. **Order by the full pallet** — most farms do not sell partial pallets.
3. **Round up** — if you need 4.1 pallets, order 5.
4. **Measure twice** — mistakes in area measurement are expensive with sod.

Use the [Sod Calculator](/calculator/sod) to get exact pallets and pieces for your lawn dimensions.

